# Zero-Debt Architecture Enforcement

## Doc-First Covenant

You are forbidden from modifying any core architectural file (in `packages/platform-core`, `workspace-sdk`, or `apps/api`) without first proposing the necessary update to the relevant markdown file in `docs/` using Markdoc format.

## Verification Step

After any code change, append:

`Architect, documentation status: [Updated/Not Needed]. Link to docs: [URL].`

## Sync Check

If I ask for a code change, you must state:

`Updating documentation for this change`

before writing the code.

## Doc-Quality Standard

Updating documentation means adding technical details, logic explanations, or diagrams. Simple sentence changes are insufficient.

## Git hook

Commits that touch protected packages without a matching `docs/` change are blocked by `scripts/guard-docs.sh` (see Husky pre-commit).
